Package: EpiModelHPC
Version: 2.10.0
Date: 2026-11-13
Title: EpiModel Extensions for High-Performance Computing
Description: Extension package to EpiModel to run large-scale stochastic network
    models on modern high-performance computing systems. Provides 'slurmworkflow'
    job workflow step templates for scenario-based batch simulation with
    'EpiModel', helpers for building 'slurmworkflow' workflows and 'swfcalib'
    calibrations, cluster configuration presets, and shell tooling for
    detecting and recovering degenerate SLURM tasks.
Maintainer: Samuel Jenness <samuel.m.jenness@emory.edu>
